Now the concise answer:
The answer is that Succubi can use Lesser Invisibility to stealth, making them invisible to other players. Therefore, you only see Warlocks with Voidwalkers because the Succubi are hidden.

Or more concisely: Because the Succubus is invisible (using Lesser Invisibility), so you don't see her with the Warlock.

Let me make sure this is accurate to Classic WoW. Yes, Lesser Invisibility was a toggleable aura that made the Succubus invisible until she entered combat or took damage. Many Warlocks kept her stealthed while traveling.

This is the best answer to the riddle.

